       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.
           TMANCRTE.
       AUTHOR.
           KURT MOVSESIAN.
      *REMARKS.

      *D************************************************************
      *D                                                           *
      *D  T M A N C R T E    THIS PROGRAMS CREATES MANIFEST FILES  *
      *D    BASED ON ONE OF THE FOLLOWING 4 OPTIONS -              *
      *D     1) 'NEW'  - CREATE A NEW MANIFEST FILE                *
      *D     2) 'REPR' - REPROCESS THE CURRENT MANIFEST FILE       *
      *D     3) 'RLSE' - RELEASE THE CURRENT MANIFEST FILE. ALSO   *
      *D         CREATE A LOCAL STORES FILE FOR LOCAL PLANT ACCTG. *
      *D     4) 'DLET' - DELETE THE CURRENT MANIFEST FILE          *
      *D                                                           *
      *D    THIS PROGRAM IS EXECUTED IN THE TEMPORARY JOB STREAM   *
      *D    'BXMANJOB.PUB' WHICH IS CREATED BY 'TMANFTHD'          *
      *D                                                           *
      *D    FILE DEFINITIONS (INPUTS/OUTPUTS)                      *
      *D       1) MANWKFL1 - FILE THAT CONTAINS A LIST OF ALL      *
      *D                    REGISTER NUMBERS CONTAINED IN THE      *
      *D                    MOST RECENT MANIFEST FILE RUN          *
      *D       2) MANAKFL1 - THE AKRON MANIFEST FILE. THIS FILE    *
      *D                    MUST BE SENT TO AKRON ACCOUNTS PAYABLE *
      *D                    ON THE IBM BEFORE ANOTHER MANIFEST     *
      *D                    FILE CAN BE CREATED                    *
      *D       3) MANSTFL1 - THE LOCAL STORES FILE USED BY THE SUB *
      *D                    PLANTS FOR THEIR LOCAL STORES ACCTG.   *
      *D                    SYSTEMS.  THIS FILE IS ONLY CREATED    *
      *D                    WHEN THE 'RLSE' MANIFEST OPTION IS     *
      *D                    SELECTED.                              *
      *D       4) MANRPTFL - REPORT FILE WHICH CONTAINS A ONE PAGE *
      *D                     SUMMARY OF WHICH OPTION WAS CHOOSEN   *
      *D                     TO CREATE THE AKRON MANIFEST FILE     *
      *D       5) STRRPTFL - A REPORT FILE WHICH DESCRIBES THE     *
      *D                     THE STORES FILE CONTENT IN A USER     *
      *D                     LEGIBLE FORMATT.  THIS FILE IS ONLY   *
      *D                     UPDATED WHEN THE 'RLSE' MANIFEST      *
      *D                     OPTION IS CHOOSEN SINCE THIS REPORT   *
      *D                     CORRESPONDS TO THE 'MANSTFL' FILE.    *
      *D                                                           *
      *D************************************************************
      *C
      *C   OCT. 1985
      *C   1. ADDED A NEW STORES RCD ID '6' WHICH CONTAINS
      *C      CONTAINERS CHARGES, OTHER, AND CPW CHARGES.
      *C      ALSO ADDED NET DUE VENDOR TO STORES RCD ID '2'
      *C      AND A TOTAL COST DISTRIBUTED GRAND TOTAL TO
      *C      RCD ID '9'
      *C   2. ADDED A MANIFEST REPORT WHICH GIVES A REGISTER
      *C      BY REGISTER LISTING WHEN EVER A 'NEW' OR 'REPR' IS
      *C      RAN. THIS WILL HELP THEM CHECK THEIR SEND TO AKRON
      *C      AND ALSO AID THEM WHEN BALANCING TO THEIR STORES
      *C      ACCOUNTING SYSTEM.
      *C   3. A SUMMARY TOTAL PAGE IS NOW PRINTED FOR A 'NEW', 'REPR'
      *C      AND 'RLSE' TO HELP IN BALANCING TO STORES ACCOUNTING.
      *C
      *C   MAY 29,1992         KURT MOVSESIAN   REQUEST# 6192
      *C   CHANGE THE 'RLSE' PROCESSING LOGIC TO NOT PASS 'GST'
      *C   PAYMENTS TO STORES 'CSAS'.  THE FILE PASSED TO CSAS WILL
      *C   NOT INCLUDE 'GST' PAYMENTS.  'GST' IS A GOODS AND SERVICE
      *C   TAX PAID BY THE CANADIAN PLANTS.  BUT THEY GET TOTAL
      *C   REIMBURSEMENT FOR THIS TAX THEY PAY TO THEIR VENDORS.
      *C   THEREFORE THEY DONT WANT THIS TAX PAYMENT GETTING PASSED
      *C   TO STORES ACCOUNTING WHERE IT WILL EFFECT THEIR LEDGERS
      *C   AND AVERAGE COST CALCULATIONS.
      *C
      *C   MAY 05, 1994        CR KALMAN        REQUEST# 6511
      *C   CREATED A LOGICAL VIEW FOR DINVRCD WITH A KEY ON INVOICESTS
      *C   TO REDUCE THE TIME SPENT ON SEARCHING THROUGH DINVRCD FOR
      *C   INVOICES TO PAY. (DIDN'T DECREASE THE PGM'S RUNNING TIME
      *C   SUBSTANTIALLY. WILL TRY SOMETHING ELSE.)
      *C
      *C   JUNE 09, 1994       CR KALMAN        REQUEST# 6511
      *C*  REPLACED OPENING, WRITING, CLOSING AND DELETING OF A FILE
      *C*  FOR EACH REGISTER IN THE MANIFEST WITH A TABLE TO DO
      *C*  THE PROCESSING.
      *C
      *C  JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C   ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C  26SEP1994   CATHY ZUBEK    REQUEST #6532
      *C  ADDED A NEW FIELD FOR CLASS OF ENTRY TO THE ID5 RECORD OF THE
      *C  MAN-STORES-FILE.
      *C
      *C  05MAY1996   CA YODER       REQ #94-005
      *C  ADDED LOGIC TO USE THE CURRENCY CODE FROM THE INVOICE IF ONE
      *C  EXISTS.  OTHERWISE, USE THE PO CURRENCY CODE.
      *C
      *C  15JUL1996   CA YODER
      *C  MODIFIED PROGRAM FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C  02JUL1997   CA YODER
      *C  CORRECTED PROBLEM OF IMPROPERLY ALLOCATING FREIGHT CHARGES
      *C  IF NO MATERIAL EXTENSION EXISTS.  WHEN THERE WAS A DIVISION
      *C  BY ZERO WHEN FIGURING THE ITM-MATL-EXT-PCNT, THE STATEMENT
      *C  WAS SKIPPED, RETAINING THE PREVIOUS INVOICE'S PERCENTAGE.
      *C  IF AN INVOICE HAS A MATERIAL EXTENSION OF ZERO AND A FREIGHT
      *C  CHARGE > ZERO, THE ITEMS ON THE INVOICE ARE COUNTED TO FIGURE
      *C  THE ALLOCATION PERCENT.
      *C
      *C  ALSO, THE TAX CHARGE WAS NOT BEING PROPERLY ALLOCATED FOR
      *C  AN INVOICE WHEN NO MATERIAL EXTENSION EXISTED.  THE TAX WAS
      *C  BEING PLACED ON THE FIRST ITEM ONLY.  USED THE NUMBER OF
      *C  ITEMS TO FIGURE OUT THE TAX PERCENTAGE.
      *C
      *C  17OCT1997   CA YODER
      *C  INCREASED SIZE OF DIST-TABLE SINCE IT WAS BLOWING UP IN
      *C  NAPANEE.  INCREASED IT FROM 100 TO 150.
      *C
      *C  03FEB1998   CA YODER
      *C  INCREASED SIZE OF DIST-TABLE TO 1000 SINCE RECEIVING NOW
      *C  HANDLES UP TO 999 ITEMS PER RECEIVING SLIP.
      *C
      *C  02APR1998   CA YODER
      *C  FOUND A PROBLEM WITH SELECTING RECORDS FOR THE SORT-FILE.
      *C  IF AN INVOICE WITH A "C" STATUS WAS FOUND, IT WOULD READ
      *C  ALL OF THE "C" RECORDS AND THEN THROUGH THE "1" RECORDS.
      *C  WHEN READING ALL OF THE "1" RECORDS, ALL OF THE INVOICES
      *C  WOULD BE DUPLICATED SINCE THEY WERE ALREADY WRITTEN
      *C  WHEN SEARCHING FOR THE "C" RECORDS.  THERE WAS NO CHECK
      *C  TO STOP AFTER ALL OF THE "C" RECORDS.  (PARAGRAPHS
      *C  61-READ-DINVRCD & 61-GET-DINVRCD.)  ADDED LOGIC TO STOP
      *C  AFTER ALL THE "C" RECORDS BEFORE SELECTING THE "1"
      *C  RECORDS.
      *C
      *C  06/02/99   CA YODER   (DECATUR REQUEST)
      *C    EXPANDED TAX RATE PERCENTAGE FROM 2 DECIMAL
      *C    PLACES TO 4.
      *C
      *C  10/20/2004  CA YODER   REQUEST #2004-99953
      *C  ADDED LOGIC TO EXCLUDE TVQ TAX IN VALUE PASSED TO CSAS
      *C  FOR VALLEYFIELD.
      *C

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.  I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT MANIFEST-REPORT
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MANRPTFL.

           SELECT STORES-REPORT
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-STRRPTFL.

9406CK*    SELECT DIST-ITEM-FILE
  .   *           ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
  .   *             ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
  .   *           RECORD KEY IS DIST-ITEM-NO
  .   *             WITH DUPLICATES
  .   *           ASSIGN TO DATABASE-DITEMFIL
9406CK*           FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT SORT-ITEMS
                  ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.

           SELECT SORT-REGISTER-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.

           SELECT REG-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MANWKFL1.

           SELECT MAN-AKRON-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MANAKFL1.

           SELECT MAN-STORES-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MANSTR.

           SELECT DPORECD-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DPOITEM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1002
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MSTORERM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DPODATAITM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DVENDOR-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.


           SELECT DPOFREIGHT-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2404
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DINVRCD-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

9405CK     SELECT DINVRCD-STS-I
  .               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2505
  .               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
  .                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
  .               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
9405CK            FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DINVITM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2601
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DINVACCT-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MTAX-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.


       DATA DIVISION.
