       FD  MANIFEST-REPORT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 133 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS MANIFEST-REPORT-RCD.
       01  MANIFEST-REPORT-RCD.
           05  MAN-CTL               PIC 9.
           05  MANIFEST-REPORT-LINE  PIC X(132).

       FD  STORES-REPORT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
