       01  STORES-REPORT-RCD.
           05  STR-CTL               PIC 9.
           05  STORES-REPORT-LINE    PIC X(132).

9406CK*FD  DIST-ITEM-FILE
  .   *    LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
  .   *    RECORD CONTAINS 69 CHARACTERS
  .   *    DATA RECORD IS DIST-ITEM-RCD.
  .   *01  DIST-ITEM-RCD.
  .   *    05  DIST-ITEM-NO          PIC X(4).
  .   *    05  DIST-CORP-CODE        PIC X(7).
  .   *    05  DIST-UM               PIC X(2).
  .   *    05  DIST-QUANTITY         PIC S9(8)V99.
  .   *    05  DIST-ITEM-VALUE       PIC S9(11)V99.
  .   *    05  DIST-ITEM-FRT         PIC S9(11)V99.
  .   *    05  DIST-ITEM-TAX         PIC S9(11)V99.
  .   *    05  DIST-ITEM-TAX-PCNT    PIC 9(2)V9(4).
9406CK*    05  DIST-MEMO-INDIC       PIC X.

       SD  SORT-ITEMS
           RECORD CONTAINS 87 CHARACTERS.
       01  SORT-ITEMS-RCD.
           05  S-ITEM                PIC 9(4).
           05  S-CORP-CODE           PIC X(7).
           05  S-CLASS               PIC X(3).
           05  S-UM                  PIC X(2).
           05  S-QUANTITY            PIC S9(8)V99.
           05  S-ITEM-DIST-COST      PIC S9(11)V99.
           05  S-ITEM-FRT            PIC S9(11)V99.
           05  S-ITEM-TAX            PIC S9(11)V99.
           05  S-ACCTG-DATA.
               10  S-PRIME           PIC X(3).
               10  S-SUB             PIC X(3).
               10  S-SUBD            PIC X(4).
               10  S-ADDL-DATA       PIC X(6).
           05  S-ITEM-PCT            PIC 9V9(4).
           05  S-ITEM-MEMO-INDIC     PIC X.

       SD  SORT-REGISTER-FILE
           RECORD CONTAINS 5 CHARACTERS.
       01  SORT-REGISTER-RCD.
           05  S-REGISTER-NO         PIC X(5).

       FD  REG-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 5 CHARACTERS.
