                            STORES-ID1-RCD,
                            STORES-ID2-RCD,
                            STORES-ID3-RCD,
                            STORES-ID4-RCD,
                            STORES-ID5-RCD,
                            STORES-ID6-RCD,
                            STORES-ID9-RCD.
       01  STORES-ID0-RCD.
